    </div>
   </div>
  </div>
  <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;text-indent:36pt;">The table below sets forth information regarding the composition of our securities portfolio and other investments at the dates indicated. At December 31, 2025, our securities portfolio contained securities issued by the United States Government and its agencies which had&#160;an aggregate book value in excess of 10% of our equity capital.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;text-indent:36pt;">&#160;</p>
