  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: center;"><b><a id="cinc" title="cinc" href="#"></a>FIRST NORTHWEST BANCORP AND SUBSIDIARY</b></p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:center;">CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF&#160;COMPREHENSIVE INCOME (LOSS)</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:center;">(dollars in thousands)</p>
