   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: center;"><b></b></p><ix:exclude><p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: center;"><b>FIRST NORTHWEST BANCORP AND SUBSIDIARY</b></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: center;">NOTES TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</p></ix:exclude><p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: center;"></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 6pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: center;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 9pt; margin: 0pt;">The following table&#160;presents the amortized cost of loans receivable by internally assigned risk grade and class of loans as of <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025</em>, as well as gross charge-off activity for the year ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025</em>. Term loans that are renewed or extended for periods longer than <em style="font: inherit;">90</em> days are presented as a new origination in the year of most recent renewal or extension.</p>
