   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">The fair values of loan servicing rights were approximately&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c141864020" contextRef="i_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:ServicingAssetAtFairValueAmount" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-6">3.0</ix:nonFraction> million and&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c141864021" contextRef="i_2024-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:ServicingAssetAtFairValueAmount" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">3.3</ix:nonFraction> million at <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em>, respectively. See Note <em style="font: inherit;">15</em>&#160;Fair Value Measurement for additional information.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">The following represents servicing and late fees earned in connection with loan servicing rights and is included in the accompanying consolidated financial statements as a component of <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c141864668"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c141864669">noninterest income</span></span> for the periods shown:</p>
