   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">The aggregate amount of time deposits issued in excess of the FDIC insured limit, currently <em style="font: inherit;">$250,000,</em> at <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em>, were&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c141864030" contextRef="i_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:TimeDepositsAtOrAboveFDICInsuranceLimit" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">164.2</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction id="c141864031" contextRef="i_2024-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:TimeDepositsAtOrAboveFDICInsuranceLimit" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">174.4</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">Maturities of certificates of deposit&#160;at the dates indicated are as follows:</p>
