eDepositsBrokered" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">10,283</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; padding: 0px 0px 1px; margin: 0px;">&#160;</td></tr>
